     3	Only a clear client refusal (HTTP 4xx other than 408/429) is unambiguous (podctl.classify_creation, r11); after an
     4	ambiguous answer the launcher sends no further request. Runpod v2 (2026-11-21): only HTTP 201 with an id is a pod; a 202
     5	answer is a queued request whose id is not a pod id, so it is ambiguous (it may still become a pod)."""
